    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lane 1: Evaluate\nOne call, several typed questions. Returns a probability (noul), a level (score) and a confidence for each.\n\nThe Autonomy Gate turns those numbers into auto, review or block. Tune the 0.90 / 0.30 thresholds to the cost of being wrong.\n\nFirst run: open the Evaluate node output and confirm the field paths used in the gate (answers.safe_to_merge.value).",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 512,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "08cdfacf-2e7f-4cb8-8358-4c28863134d0",
      "name": "Sticky Note e757308b",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lane 2: Route\nOne question, one output per answer. With \"separate output\" confidence handling, low-confidence items go to a Fallback output instead of a forced guess.",
        "height": 128,
        "width": 416,
        "color": 5
      },
